  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vcard\" style=\"width: 22em\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" class=\"n\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 125%\"><span class=\"fn\">Miriam Weinstein</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c7/Miriam_Weinstein.png/revision/latest?cb=20180621144615\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c7/Miriam_Weinstein.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20180621144615\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"322\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Miriam Weinstein.png\" data-image-key=\"Miriam_Weinstein.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:110%;\"><hr /><div style=\"background:lavender;\"><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">63rd</a>&#160;President of the United States</div>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>President\n</th>\n<td>January 20, 2121 - January 20, 2129\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Preceded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Christopher_Reagan\" title=\"Christopher Reagan\">Christopher Reagan</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Succeeded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Thang_Levin\" title=\"Thang Levin\">Thang Levin</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Born\n</th>\n<td>May 13, 2052<br />Tampa Bay, FL\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Nationality\n</th>\n<td>American\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th>Political&#160;party\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Progress_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Progress Party (United States)\">Progressive</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Religion\n</th>\n<td>Judaism\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Miriam Rose Weinstein</b> was the 63rd President of the United States (2121-2129). A Progressive lawyer from Florida, Weinstein worked her way up the ladder of Georgia state politics, eventually becoming governor of that state. She was elected vice president under <a href=\"/wiki/Estela_La_Riva\" title=\"Estela La Riva\">Estela La Riva</a> 2104 and was re-elected Governor of Georgia 2 years after La Riva's defeat in 2108. Weinstein remained a popular figure in Progressive politics and ran in her own right for the Presidency in 2121, where her reputation as a moderate Progressive proved an asset. Her otherwise successful Presidency was beset by a series of patronage scandals in her second term that damaged her otherwise popular reputation. However, she is still remembered fondly by most Americans.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Presidency\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Presidency</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Colonial_Policy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Colonial Policy</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#2124_Campaign\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>2124 Campaign</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#United_States_Sesquarcentennial\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>United States Sesquarcentennial</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Patronage_scandals\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Patronage scandals</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Presidency\">Presidency</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiriam_Weinstein%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colonial_Policy\"><b>Colonial Policy</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiriam_Weinstein%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Weinstein was the first President to make a sincere push for colonial integration, calling for the inclusion of several Lunar territories as states in the Union. Congress narrowly passed an authorization package that established a vote for statehood in the Lunar territories, but the final votes for admission to the Union were blocked by Horizon and Dignidad.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2124_Campaign\"><b>2124 Campaign</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiriam_Weinstein%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"United_States_Sesquarcentennial\"><b>United States Sesquarcentennial</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiriam_Weinstein%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patronage_scandals\"><b>Patronage scandals</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiriam_Weinstein%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 2026111812231